        "role": "code",
        "envelope": {
          "content": {
            "source": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\n/* 节点：数据域 data + 指针域 next */\ntypedef struct Node {\n    int data;\n    struct Node *next;\n} Node;\n\n/* 头插法：把 data 放入新节点，插到链表最前端，返回新的头指针 */\nNode *insert_head(Node *head, int data)\n{\n    Node *new_node = (Node *)malloc(sizeof(Node));\n    if (new_node == NULL) {\n        return head; /* 分配失败，保持原链表不变 */\n    }\n    new_node->data = data;\n    new_node->next = head; /* 第一步：新节点接到原链表前面 */\n    head = new_node;       /* 第二步：头指针改指向新节点 */\n    return head;\n}\n\n/* 遍历：从 head 出发沿 next 依次打印，直到 NULL */\nvoid print_list(Node *head)\n{\n    Node *p = head;\n    while (p != NULL) {\n        printf(\"%d \", p->data);\n        p = p->next;\n    }\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n}\n\n/* 释放：先保存 next，再 free 当前节点，最后 head 置为 NULL */\nvoid free_list(Node *head)\n{\n    Node *p = head;\n    while (p != NULL) {\n        Node *next = p->next;\n        free(p);\n        p = next;\n    }\n}\n\nint main(void)\n{\n    Node *head = NULL; /* 空链表：head -> NULL */\n\n    head = insert_head(head, 1); /* head -> [1] -> NULL */\n    head = insert_head(head, 2); /* head -> [2] -> [1] -> NULL */\n    head = insert_head(head, 3); /* head -> [3] -> [2] -> [1] -> NULL */\n\n    print_list(head); /* 输出：3 2 1 */\n\n    free_list(head);\n    head = NULL; /* 释放后置空，避免悬空指针 */\n\n    return 0;\n}",
            "language": "C",
            "key_steps": [
              "定义节点结构体 Node：data 存数据，next 指向后继节点；main 中 head = NULL 表示空链表 head -> NULL。",
              "insert_head 中先 malloc 新节点并写入 data，再执行 new_node->next = head，把新节点接到原链表前面。",
              "紧接着执行 head = new_node，让头指针指向新节点；两步顺序不能颠倒，否则原链表会丢失。",
              "依次头插 1、2、3，链表状态依次变为 head -> [1] -> NULL、head -> [2] -> [1] -> NULL、head -> [3] -> [2] -> [1] -> NULL。",
              "print_list 用游标 p = head 沿 next 遍历打印，得到 3 2 1，因为最后插入的节点离 head 最近。",
              "free_list 循环中先保存 next 再 free(p)，最后 head = NULL，释放全部节点。"
            ],
            "display_only": true,
            "expected_output": "3 2 1"
          },
